@startuml
title Prepwise — Student preparation workflow
start
:Student signs in;
:Open dashboard and review saved activity;
if (Choose a preparation area) then (Questions)
  :Filter by category and difficulty;
  :Answer or reflect on a question;
  :Save practice activity;
elseif (Mock test)
  :Start timed attempt;
  :Answer and navigate questions;
  if (Timer expires?) then (Yes)
    :Server automatically submits;
  else (No)
    :Student submits test;
  endif
  :Validate IDs and score on server;
  :Persist result and answer review;
elseif (Coding)
  :Read problem, sample, and hints;
  :Enter source code and observed output;
  :Compare entered output to sample only;
  :Store sample pass/fail without executing code;
elseif (HR)
  :Select HR prompt;
  :Draft and save personal response;
endif
:Update progress from stored activity;
if (Measured performance available?) then (Yes)
  :Generate rule-based recommendations;
else (No)
  :Show onboarding suggestions;
endif
:Review next step;
stop
@enduml
